   Do nothing if text is not a Unicode object. The function accepts Unicode
   string which is not ready (PyUnicode_WCHAR_KIND).

   This function is signal safe. */
PyAPI_FUNC(void) _Py_DumpASCII(int fd, PyObject *text);

